{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさーんっ(((っ･ω･)っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうすぐ年明けですね～♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2012/12/31/3714926/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2012年どんな年でしたか？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一言じゃ言い表せないなぁ(*´･ω･`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず2012年が始まってすぐ\n乃木坂46がCDデビューをして\nそれを私は家でみてました☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでそのあと私は\n大学受験を終えてレッスンに\n参加し始めました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パルコ公演も実は\nずっと見てたんですよ(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観に来てくださった\nみなさんのことも見てたっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして10月！\n10/8の乃木どこで選抜発表で\n私は復帰させてもらいました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はじめは申し訳ない気持ちで\nほんとにほんとに一杯だったけど\nいつまでもそんなんじゃ\nいけないから今は周りの人も\n自分も楽しめるようにできたらな\nって思ってます(*^^*)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2013年はまだあんまり\n喋ったりしてないメンバーとも\n仲良くなれたらいいなぁ(*´･ω･`)♡\nっていう願望もあるんだよ？♪//"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でわでわ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2012年のまなったんの\n漢字一文字を発表します(((っ･ω･)っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どぅるどぅるどぅるどぅる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただんっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『涙』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ですヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たぶんね、今までで\n1番泣いた年だったと思う(´･ω･ゞ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもその分きっと\n強～くなったんだよヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というわけで、もうすぐ今年も\n終わっちゃうねっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあメッセージ付き写メを∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひょいっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2012/12/31/3714926/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来年もまなったんを\n見守ってくださいね～♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2012/12/31/3714926/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいばい(((っ･ω･)っ2012年！"}],"source":"archive"}